    {
      "type": "examAlert",
      "items": [
        "Questions often ask to categorize software: Compilers, Device Drivers, and Operating Systems are System Software, while Antivirus and Disk Defragmenters are Utility Software.",
        "Compilers convert high-level code to machine code in one go, whereas Interpreters translate line-by-line.",
        "Application software cannot run independently without the underlying System Software."
      ],
      "id": "3rp9t18"
